
# Spinner — headless. A loading indicator (theme the animation in CSS). role=status for a11y.
load @term/site/code/zone/render
  find element
load @term/site/code/dom/dom
  find view
  find append

zone spinner
  take host, like view
  take class
  zone span
    bind data-slot, text <spinner>
    bind role, text <status>
    bind aria-label, text <Loading>
    bind class, read class
    site
